              Stay informed about our ongoing relief efforts and organizational updates.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div className="hidden sm:flex gap-2">
            <button
              onClick={prev}
              disabled={currentIndex === 0}
              className="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-border bg-white flex items-center justify-center hover:border-primary hover:text-primary transition-colors disabled:opacity-40 disabled:cursor-not-allowed"
            >
              <ChevronLeft className="w-5 h-5" />
            </button>
            <button
              onClick={next}
              disabled={currentIndex >= maxIndex}
              className="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-border bg-white flex items-center justify-center hover:border-primary hover:text-primary transition-colors disabled:opacity-40 disabled:cursor-not-allowed"
